2eef961d feat(demos/sa3): Steer section with one slider per steering knob
Knobs whose manifest name has the steer_ prefix (steering packs) show as
sliders in a Steer section under the knob grid instead of rotary knobs.
Range and default come from the manifest; double-click resets to 0.
The section stays hidden when the session has no packs. No family or
pack specific code.


