7bf6e260 feat(steering): discovery and live-stream sanity tools
scripts/steering/discover.py writes prompt-pair difference-of-means
packs for any family with a driver (sa3, acestep): N paired generations
through the real StreamPipeline, per-block mean difference of the
post-block residual, block chosen by a residual patching sweep, knob
calibration stored in provenance. proxies.py holds the spectral concept
proxies; sanity_sa3_stream.py checks packs on the production TRT backend
(knob 0 bit-identical to no packs, direction at +/-K, tick time).

SA3 medium packs (bright, warm, rough, density, percussive): knob 0
bit-identical; bright, warm and percussive move their proxy the right
way on 3/3 prompts at knob +/-1 and +/-10. Steer engine tick 52.1 ms
(knob 0) / 52.8 ms (active) vs 43.2 ms on the default fp8 engine.


