4581c568 feat(sa3): DiT TensorRT engine with the activation-steering input
sa3_steering_onnx adds steering [1, blocks, hidden] to Stability's
fp16mixed DiT graph by proto-only surgery (block outputs found
structurally; one fp16 cast, a Gather and an Add per block, the ACE
post-block convention). The builder parses the surgered proto in memory
against the original path, so the weight sidecar is never copied:
sa3_build --steer builds sa3_m_dit_steer_l* next to the existing
engines. Discovery picks it when the session has steering packs;
SA3TRTDit binds the input and only rewrites it while steering is active.
scripts/sa3/sa3_trt_steer_parity.py gates zero and nonzero steering vs
eager and times the step.


