12f08551 feat(steering): vector packs as data, registered as steer_* knobs
One .safetensors file per vector (unit vector + JSON metadata: family,
checkpoint, hook, block, hidden size, name, label, method, norm,
magnitude, per-step policy, provenance). The loader scans
DEMON_STEERING_PACKS_DIR (default <models>/steering_packs), keeps packs
for the booted family/checkpoint that fit the loaded model's steering
layout, and attaches them to any diffusion backend; each becomes a
steer_<name> knob from the shared registry factory, merged with the ACE
built-in axes into the pipeline's single steering slot. The ACE axes
stay in code; the pack loader is additive.


