1885aeec feat(steering): family-agnostic steering slot behind the adapter seam
StreamPipeline keeps ONE steering slot ([B, num_blocks, hidden] additive
shift per forward) and delivers it by the adapter's declared
SteeringLayout: eager hooks on the adapter's block list, the ACE TRT
buffer fill, or a steering= tensor for adapters that take it as an
engine input. Configs gain an optional per-step policy curve next to
the historical one-hot step gate. ACE declares its layout and keeps its
exact numerics; SA3 declares eager blocks and threads steering to the
TRT DiT. Hooks are removable (pipeline close, engine swap).


